{
  "schema": "ocd-tags/v1",
  "note": "One tag vocabulary for backdrops, poses, views, outfits, people and occasions. A tag set carries any subset of these dimensions; a dimension it leaves out says nothing, and is never read as a match or a mismatch. Time, weather and season are read from a backdrop's variant, never typed by hand. place is set only where a thing really belongs to one place.",
